Deathmatch** \u2013 Work together and dominate as a squad\n\n- **Deathmatch** \u2013 Every player for themselves, no mercy\n\n{1461129098441055}\n\n# What to Expect\n\n**Constant updates**: new maps, new guns, and fresh cosmetics\n\n**Daily**, **weekly**, **and monthly quests** to keep the action rewarding\n\n**Party up** and jump straight into the action with friends\n\n{798544342560458}", "short_description": " In **Overload** \u2014 a fast-paced multiplayer shooter where you can battle solo or team up with friends. Choose from **10+ powerful weapons** , customize your look with tons of cosmetics, and build your squad by adding friends to your in-game list."}]}, "developer_name": "5Vstudios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://5vstudios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "5Vstudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://5vstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25314254394935951"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1181381977460043_3756049111659606630_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pSaFd7-ucsIQ7kNvwHAbU62&_nc_oc=AdqSCVUAXN9EfnUeUIYG6AZ4pj1poBs9nVt